atlas/colorado/archuleta-county"],["ARC or PLC in Archuleta County","/arc-plc/colorado/archuleta-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025 that same middle saw Jan-Feb at 39% of normal and Sep-Oct at 170%. So far in 2026, Feb-Mar is at 37% and May-Jun at 56%. Grid 20194 had its driest year in 1956 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
